ng pairs (B3-B3, F2-F2, J2-J2) plus the T2-T3-T4 chow structure. This gives me multiple paths to complete a winning hand, particularly aiming for pungs of honor tiles (F2 or J2) which could score Prevalent Wind (F2=North Wind) or Dragon Pung (J2=Green Dragon) patterns.\n\nAnswer: Play W5"}
